    <tr><th>On v2 (2026-10-19, via lead 14)</th><th></th></tr>
    <tr><td>Up to nine events before career progression is complete; shorten some, make them faster</td><td>Nine in Days 1-26; the inspector shortened; the comet earlier (v3).</td></tr>
