    <tr><td>Loss of Power: four game hours in the lift after your first meal; no penalty for missing work</td><td>Day 24, 07:40-11:40; jobs wait, no reputation lost.</td></tr>
    <tr><td>The nine are made first, the others later</td><td>Phase 1 and Phase 2 (above).</td></tr>
  </table></div>
</section>

