    <tr><td>6-7 Sat-Sun</td><td></td><td>— (free)</td><td></td><td>your first full weekend: Sowing morning (6), film night's first night in the auditorium (6)</td></tr>
    <tr><td>8 Mon</td><td><span class="tag new">P1</span></td><td><b>3. Space Creature</b> (09:00-18:40)</td><td>cozy</td><td>your first small incident and your uniform (quiet lessons); a free evening before the test</td></tr>
    <tr><td>9-11</td><td></td><td>—</td><td></td><td><b>test job, Officer, the ceremony</b></td></tr>
    <tr><td>12-15 Fri-Mon</td><td><span class="tag new">P1</span></td><td><b>4. Diplomatic visit</b></td><td>cozy</td><td>tracing day (Mail only); guests over the weekend and at talent night (14); gone before Monday's <b>Tier 3 test</b> <span style="opacity:.6">(Captain's Day, 13, would move)</span></td></tr>
    <tr><td>16</td><td></td><td>—</td><td></td><td><b>Senior Officer</b></td></tr>
    <tr><td>17 Wed</td><td><span class="tag new">P1</span></td><td><b>5. Power surge</b> (11:20-15:00)</td><td>danger</td><td>your power lesson (M19); the Captain's table toast that evening</td></tr>
    <tr><td>18 Thu</td><td><span class="tag new">P1</span></td><td><b>6. Echo Signal</b> (20:30)</td><td>cozy</td><td>shutdowns (M18); the evening before your first night shift</td></tr>
    <tr><td>19-20</td><td></td><td>—</td><td></td><td><b>the night shift</b></td></tr>
    <tr><td>21 Sun</td><td><span class="tag new">P1</span></td><td><b>7. Distress call</b> (11:30-16:30)</td><td>danger</td><td>your day off after the night shift</td></tr>
    <tr><td>22-23</td><td></td><td>—</td><td></td><td><b>Tier 4 test, Engine Specialist</b> (bridge hour on 23)</td></tr>
    <tr><td>24 Wed</td><td><span class="tag new">P1</span></td><td><b>8. Loss of Power</b> (07:40-11:40)</td><td>cozy-tense</td><td>the reactor permit waits for the afternoon; the inspector's warning Mail at 16:00 <span style="opacity:.6">(Odd Socks Day)</span></td></tr>
    <tr><td>25 Thu</td><td><span class="tag new">P1</span></td><td><b>9. Visiting Inspector</b></td><td>tense</td><td>leading your first team job (M24): she watches it</td></tr>
    <tr><td>26 Fri</td><td></td><td>—</td><td></td><td><b>Calder's question</b> (she can mention the findings)</td></tr>
